# LeakSanitizer Suppression File for Zenith DAW
# This file suppresses known false positives and third-party library leaks

# ONNX Runtime - Known false positive
# The ONNX Runtime library performs internal allocations that are not freed
# until process termination, which is intentional for performance reasons.
leak:libonnxruntime.so

# ONNX Runtime global state
leak:Ort::GetApi
leak:OrtApis
leak:onnxruntime
